      "ambienceVolume": 0.22,
      "se": "../assets/audio/ambience/bell_far_01.mp3?v=20260704",
      "seVolume": 0.24
    },
    {
      "id": "scene001-02",
      "scene": "scene001",
      "text": "冷たい雨が、王都を静かに包んでおった。",
      "speaker": "",
      "hideName": true,
      "icon": "../assets/characters/garyuton.png?v=20260704",
      "iconAlt": "ガリュ㌧"
    },
    {
      "id": "scene001-03",
      "scene": "scene001",
      "text": "誰もまだ、この雨が一人の少年の運命を変えるとは知らなんだ。",
      "speaker": "",
      "hideName": true,
      "icon": "../assets/characters/garyuton.png?v=20260704",
      "iconAlt": "ガリュ㌧",
      "forceTransition": true,
      "nextSceneId": "scene002-01"
    },
    {
      "id": "scene002-01",
      "scene": "scene002",
      "text": "「……今度の子は、どうでしょうね？」",
      "background": "../assets/cg/rain_rescue.png?v=20260704",
      "characters": [],
      "icon": null,
      "speaker": "王妃",
      "bgm": null,
      "ambience": "../assets/audio/ambience/rain_loop_01.mp3?v=20260704",
      "ambienceVolume": 0.22
    },
    {
      "id": "scene002-02",
      "scene": "scene002",
      "text": "「分からぬ。」",
      "speaker": "国王"
    },
    {
      "id": "scene002-03",
      "scene": "scene002",
      "text": "「だが。」",
      "speaker": "国王"
    },
    {
      "id": "scene002-04",
      "scene": "scene002",
      "text": "「あの方の言葉を。」",
      "speaker": "国王"
    },
    {
      "id": "scene002-05",
      "scene": "scene002",
      "text": "「信じよう。」",
      "speaker": "国王"
    },
    {
      "id": "scene002-06",
      "scene": "scene002",
      "text": "こうして、名もなき少年は王城へ連れて行かれたのじゃ。",
      "speaker": "",
      "hideName": true,
      "icon": "../assets/characters/garyuton.png?v=20260704",
      "iconAlt": "ガリュ㌧"
    },
    {
      "id": "scene002-07",
      "scene": "scene002",
      "text": "人々はそれを、王の慈悲と呼んだ。",
      "speaker": "",
      "hideName": true,
      "icon": "../assets/characters/garyuton.png?v=20260704",
      "iconAlt": "ガリュ㌧"
    },
    {
      "id": "scene002-08",
      "scene": "scene002",
      "text": "じゃが、その奥には、ひとつの古き約束があったのじゃ。",
      "speaker": "",
      "hideName": true,
      "icon": "../assets/characters/garyuton.png?v=20260704",
      "iconAlt": "ガリュ㌧",
      "forceTransition": true,
      "nextSceneId": "scene003-01"
    },
    {
      "id": "scene003-01",
      "scene": "scene003",
      "text": "少年が目を覚ましたのは、城の下男宿舎じゃった。",
      "speaker": "",
      "hideName": true,
      "icon": "../assets/characters/garyuton.png?v=20260704",
      "iconAlt": "ガリュ㌧",
      "background": "../assets/bg/servants_dormitory_morning.png?v=20260704",
      "characters": [],
      "bgm": null,
      "ambience": "../assets/audio/ambience/birds_morning_01.mp3?v=20260704",
      "ambienceVolume": 0.22
    },
    {
      "id": "scene003-02",
      "scene": "scene003",
      "text": "豪華ではない。",
      "speaker": "",
      "hideName": true,
      "icon": "../assets/characters/garyuton.png?v=20260704",
      "iconAlt": "ガリュ㌧"
    },
    {
      "id": "scene003-03",
      "scene": "scene003",
      "text": "じゃが、雨風をしのげる屋根があり、温かい寝床があった。",
      "speaker": "",
      "hideName": true,
      "icon": "../assets/characters/garyuton.png?v=20260704",
      "iconAlt": "ガリュ㌧"
    },
    {
      "id": "scene003-04",
      "scene": "scene003",
      "text": "孤児であった少年にとっては、それだけで十分すぎる場所じゃった。",
      "speaker": "",
      "hideName": true,
      "icon": "../assets/characters/garyuton.png?v=20260704",
      "iconAlt": "ガリュ㌧"
    },
    {
      "id": "scene003-05",
      "scene": "scene003",
      "text": "「起きたか。」",
      "speaker": "下男A",
      "icon": null
    },
    {
      "id": "scene003-06",
      "scene": "scene003",
      "text": "「ほら、朝飯。」",
      "speaker": "下男B"
    },
    {
      "id": "scene003-07",
      "scene": "scene003",
      "text": "「冷める前に食えよ。」",
      "speaker": "下男B"
    },
    {
      "id": "scene003-08-name",
      "scene": "scene003",
      "text": "",
      "speaker": "",
      "action": "nameInput"
    },
    {
      "id": "scene003-09",
      "scene": "scene003",
      "text": "「{playerName}か。」",
      "speaker": "下男A"
    },
    {
      "id": "scene003-10",
      "scene": "scene003",
      "text": "「今日からお前も仲間だ。」",
      "speaker": "下男A"
    },
    {
      "id": "scene003-11",
      "scene": "scene003",
      "text": "「よろしくな、{playerName}！」",
      "speaker": "下男B"
    },
    {
      "id": "scene003-12",
      "scene": "scene003",
      "text": "「……はい。」",
      "speaker": "主人公"
    },
    {
      "id": "scene003-13",
      "scene": "scene003",
      "text": "この短い返事から、少年の新しい日々が始まったのじゃ。",
      "speaker": "",
      "hideName": true,
      "icon": "../assets/characters/garyuton.png?v=20260704",
      "iconAlt": "ガリュ㌧",
      "forceTransition": true,
      "ambienceFadeOutMs": 800,
      "nextSceneId": "scene004-01"
    },
    {
      "id": "scene004-01",
      "scene": "scene004",
      "text": "少年はよく働いた。",
      "speaker": "",
      "hideName": true,
      "icon": "../assets/characters/garyuton.png?v=20260704",
      "iconAlt": "ガリュ㌧",
      "background": "../assets/bg/servants_dormitory_morning.png?v=20260704",
      "characters": [],
      "bgm": null,
      "ambience": null
    },
    {
      "id": "scene004-02",
      "scene": "scene004",
      "text": "掃除。",
      "speaker": "",
      "hideName": true,
      "icon": "../assets/characters/garyuton.png?v=20260704",
      "iconAlt": "ガリュ㌧"
    },
    {
      "id": "scene004-03",
      "scene": "scene004",
      "text": "薪運び。",
      "speaker": "",
      "hideName": true,
      "icon": "../assets/characters/garyuton.png?v=20260704",
      "iconAlt": "ガリュ㌧"
    },
    {
      "id": "scene004-04",
      "scene": "scene004",
      "text": "馬小屋の世話。",
      "speaker": "",
      "hideName": true,
      "icon": "../assets/characters/garyuton.png?v=20260704",
      "iconAlt": "ガリュ㌧"
    },
    {
      "id": "scene004-05",
      "scene": "scene004",
      "text": "できることは多くなかったが、それでも毎日を懸命に生きておった。",
      "speaker": "",
      "hideName": true,
      "icon": "../assets/characters/garyuton.png?v=20260704",
      "iconAlt": "ガリュ㌧"
    },
    {
      "id": "scene004-06",
      "scene": "scene004",
      "text": "誰かの役に立つ。",
      "speaker": "",
      "hideName": true,
      "icon": "../assets/characters/garyuton.png?v=20260704",
      "iconAlt": "ガリュ㌧"
    },
    {
      "id": "scene004-07",
      "scene": "scene004",
      "text": "それは、少年にとって初めて知る喜びでもあった。",
      "speaker": "",
      "hideName": true,
      "icon": "../assets/characters/garyuton.png?v=20260704",
      "iconAlt": "ガリュ㌧"
    },
    {
      "id": "scene004-08",
      "scene": "scene004",
      "text": "「おい、{playerName}！」",
      "speaker": "下男A",
      "icon": null
    },
    {
      "id": "scene004-09",
      "scene": "scene004",
      "text": "「今日も助かったぞ。」",
      "speaker": "下男A"
    },
    {
      "id": "scene004-10",
      "scene": "scene004",
      "text": "「……ありがとうございます。」",
      "speaker": "主人公"
    },
    {
      "id": "scene004-11",
      "scene": "scene004",
      "text": "「お前、口数は少ないけど根性あるよな。」",
      "speaker": "下男B"
    },
    {
      "id": "scene004-12",
      "scene": "scene004",
      "text": "「ま、下男としては合格だ。」",
      "speaker": "下男A"
    },
    {
      "id": "scene004-13",
      "scene": "scene004",
      "text": "「……はい。」",
      "speaker": "主人公",
      "nextSceneId": "scene005-01"
    },
    {
      "id": "scene005-01",
      "scene": "scene005",
